<%--
_Sys_Email_Preview - a rendered email, shown in a SANDBOXED iframe.

$html - the document to show (required): _Sys_Email_Controller::detail's
        preview_html, which carries its own Content-Security-Policy refusing every
        remote load (inline styles and data: images/fonts only).

The iframe is sandbox="" - no scripts, no forms, no popups, an opaque origin with no
access to the panel - and the document arrives through srcdoc, never a URL. A remote
image (a logo, a tracking pixel) is therefore not fetched, and a cid: inline image
shows as missing: this is the markup that was sent, not a mail client.
--%>
<Define:_Sys_Email_Preview>
    <iframe $sid="frame" class="_Sys_Email_Preview__frame" sandbox="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" title="Rendered email"></iframe>
</Define:_Sys_Email_Preview>
